         "text": [
            {
                "text": "#### The Mesoamericans\n\nWhat we have presented in this lesson so far is not something new created by *History Tracers*. Thousands of years ago, a counting system — or number system — was created in a region known as Mesoamerica, as shown in the figure.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown/html/text",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<img src=\"https://www.historytracers.org/images/Mapswire/mapswire-continent_na-printable-map-north-america-robinson-269_mesoamerica2.jpg\" />",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": [],
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
                "text": "*Image provided by Mapswire*",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": [],
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "ecfabf83-4d09-4969-a960-4594ed95f37a",
         "prev": "",
