               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
                "text": "#### Examples\n\nCounting in Mesoamerica took place in different settings, such as dates.\n\nIn the following image, we see the dots we taught in this lesson, made on a stela built in the past in Oaxaca - Mexico.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown/html/text",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
