        "text": [
          {
            "text": "#### Conclusion\n\nIn this lesson, we learned how to count by associating images with our fingers. As an example, we used the numbers employed in Mesoamerica for more than a millennium.\n\nIn the next lesson, we will begin to study the numbers used today.",
            "source": [],
            "date_time": null,
            "isTable": false,
